# Data

This folder documents every dataset used by the notebooks. The datasets are **not stored in git** (the archives are large). Each one is produced by a MATLAB script in [`matlab/data_generation/`](../matlab/data_generation/), or can be downloaded from the link below.

> **Download:** `<Zenodo / GitHub Releases link>`

